  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I call for my mother. She is, um, she found a cat. A lost cat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a lost cat. Let me get some details. Where is the cat right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At her house. One one eight Kingston Avenue. She is not, she cannot keep it. Already two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 118 Kingston Avenue. And you're calling on her behalf, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I am her son. I am here with her, and I tell her what you say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can you describe the cat for me? Size, color?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Medium. Not big, not small. Gray, with white on the feet. And the chest, white also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gray with white paws and chest. Does it have a collar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a collar. Red. No tag, she say. Only the collar. [pause] Sorry, the radio is on, the local station. I make it lower."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear it a little. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now is lower. I call already yesterday, a different number, nobody answer. Is a hassle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Animal control handles found pets, so I'll take your information and pass it along. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight two. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dominic Pellegrino."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Pellegrino. I'll send this over today, and someone should call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today. Thank you."
    }
  ],
